  "remarks": "Joint Stock Company “Sokol Asset” is a Russian company which owns JSC VNIIR-Progress. JSC VNIIR-Progress is a Russian research and development institute that specialises in the production of advanced electronic warfare systems, in particular technologies for signal-jamming and intelligence-gathering. It is part of the “ABS Electro” Group of companies.",
